Package: SimpleMetaPipeline
Title: A Simple Bioinformatic Pipeline for Metabarcoding
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jake", "Williams", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2415-8584"))
Description: A reproducible bioinformatic pipeline for metabarcoding data,
    integrating Cutadapt, DADA2, LULU, VSEARCH/Swarm, IDTAXA and BLAST into a
    single workflow controlled via a configuration object. Produces a unified
    SeqDataTable retaining ESVs, OTUs, and curated variants simultaneously,
    enabling multi-algorithm agreement tests.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/J-Cos/SimpleMetaPipeline
